  "body": "CCC and Title Issued - Move In and Enjoy Immediately!\r\nNestled in one of East Auckland's most desirable neighbourhoods, this beautifully crafted standalone residence delivers the perfect balance of style, space, and everyday convenience. Designed with modern families in mind, this brand-new home offers a timeless lifestyle in the heart of the coveted Macleans zone.\r\nThe thoughtfully designed ground floor is all about comfort and connection. A sleek open-plan kitchen, appointed with quality appliances, seamlessly integrates with the spacious living and dining areas, flowing effortlessly onto a sun-soaked deck - an ideal space for entertaining or unwinding with family and friends. A generously sized guest bedroom with its own ensuite, together with a separate powder room, provides excellent flexibility for extended family or visitors.\r\nUpstairs, four well-proportioned bedrooms offer plenty of room for growing families. The luxurious master suite features a walk-in wardrobe and private ensuite, while a stylish family bathroom services the remaining bedrooms, all fitted with double wardrobes for added practicality.\r\nFeatures You'll Love:\r\n• Brand-new standalone home with freehold title\r\n• Five spacious bedrooms and 3.5 bathrooms, including two master ensuites\r\n• Internal-access garage with dedicated laundry and storage area\r\n• Three heat pumps ensuring year-round comfort\r\n• Zoned for top-tier schools - just a short stroll to Macleans Primary School, Bucklands Beach Intermediate and Macleans College\r\n• Minutes from Half Moon Bay Marina and ferry terminal for an easy CBD commute\r\n• Close to beautiful beaches, reserves, local shops, cafés and popular eateries\r\n• Backed by a 10-Year builder warranty plus one year of complimentary maintenance\r\nOffering exceptional space, premium finishes and an unbeatable location, this stunning home presents an outstanding opportunity to secure a quality lifestyle in one of East Auckland's most prestigious family communities.\r\nAct quickly - contact us today to arrange your private viewing and experience everything this exceptional home has to offer.",
